:userdoc.
:title.Ribble Information
:h1 res=10000.General help
:i1 sortkey='a'.General help
:p.
:artwork name='..\bitmaps\ribblestatic.bmp' align=center.
:p.
:hp2.Ribble:ehp2. is a Boulder-dash clone written specifically
for OS/2's Presentation Manager.
:p.
Select one of the following hyperlinks&colon.
:p.
:lm margin=5.
