:h1 res=10023.Options... dialog
:i1.Options... dialog
:p.
Use the controls in this dialog to&colon.
:lm margin=5.
:p.
&sqbul. alter the keys used to move :hp2.Ribble:ehp2. around
:lm margin=8.
:p.
The three possible selections are&colon.
:lm margin=10.
:p.
&sqbul. :hp1.Arrow:ehp1., cursor keys.
:p.
&sqbul. :hp1.Classic:ehp1., where Z = left, X = right, ' (apostrophe) = up, and
/ (forward slash) = down.
:p.
&sqbul. :hp1.Other:ehp1., whatever you like.
:lm margin=5.
:p.
&sqbul. alter various settings in order to tune performance
:lm margin=8.
:p.
&sqbul. :hp1.Refresh rate:ehp1., the delay in milliseconds between
window refreshes.
:p.
&sqbul. :hp1.Cell dimensions:ehp1., the size of each cell in the window.
The default is 64x64, for a 64 pel by 64 pel cell.
:p.
&sqbul. :hp1.Visible dimensions:ehp1., the size of the playing area
viewed in the window.  The default is 14x14 for a 14 cell by 14 cell
view.
:lm margin=1.
